  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0290_a5e990457f57.jpg\" style=\"width: 294px; height: 196px;\" />&nbsp;</p><p>As shown in figure two cells are connected in parallel with the load resistance of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>. Let current&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;drawn from both cells as shown, from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Apply <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>.</mo></math> for loop <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>F</mi></math>,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>From equations&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, for loop <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi></math>,&nbsp;</p><p>Apply <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>From equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>23</mn><mn>32</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p>So, net current in external load&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>23</mn><mn>32</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>37</mn><mn>32</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p>Then potential difference for a given load,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>37</mn><mn>32</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>56</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p><p>So, the potential difference lies between,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>11</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>11</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>.</p>"
  }
}